      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG2_U04_L03_Q07</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U04_L03_Q07</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.FM.2; MLA.A2.FM.3; MLA.A2.FM.4</p><p>A savings account starts at 700 and grows by 2% annually. Which model fits?</p>]]></text>
