      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U04_L03_Q14</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.FM.2; MLA.A2.FM.3; MLA.A2.FM.4</p><p>A 4000 dollar balance grows by factor 1.05 for 2 years. Which expression evaluates the balance?</p>]]></text>
