      <text>ALG2_U04_L03_Q15</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U04_L03_Q15</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.FM.2; MLA.A2.FM.3; MLA.A2.FM.4</p><p>A 9000 dollar asset is modeled by V(t)=9000(0.70)ᵗ. What is the depreciation rate?</p>]]></text>
